格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"High-performance, capability-aware repository tools and process execution for coding agents.","id":"gh:1322407852","install_available":false,"language":"Rust","name":"agentshim","slug":"possible055/agentshim","topics":["agent","codex","cordis","dsh-plugin","mcp","rust","vibe-coding"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"High-performance, capability-aware repository tools and process execution for coding agents."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# AgentShim"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 简体中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"AgentShim gives coding agents tools to read and search files and run commands. Codex and Cursor conn"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"ect to its local MCP server; DSH can use the native adapter instead."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Windows x64, Linux x64, and Linux ARM64 are natively supported. A compatibility release is also avai"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"lable for macOS Apple Silicon."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Quick start"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"### 1. Install"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"On Windows, run in PowerShell:"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"On Linux or macOS Apple Silicon, run:"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"The installer prints the executable's absolute path. By default, it installs to:"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"| System | Executable |"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"| Windows | `%LOCALAPPDATA%\\agentshim\\bin\\agentshim.exe` |\n| Linux | `${XDG_DATA_HOME:-$HOME/.local/"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"share}/agentshim/bin/agentshim` |\n| macOS | `${XDG_DATA_HOME:-$HOME/.local/share}/agentshim/bin/agen"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"gentshim/bin/agentshim` |\n| macOS | `${XDG_DATA_HOME:-$HOME/.local/share}/agentshim/bin/agentshim` |"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Re-running the command installs the latest stable release. It can downgrade an existing prerelease, "},{"id":"p15s2","text":"so check your current version first. To install a specific release, including an alpha, replace `0.1"},{"id":"p15s3","text":".7-alpha.3` below with the desired published version:"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"These commands install the specified version; they do not automatically track newer alpha releases. "},{"id":"p18s2","text":"If you used a custom directory, pass the same directory with `-InstallDir` (PowerShell) or `--instal"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"l-dir` (sh) so the MCP configuration continues to point to the updated executable. Restart your MCP "},{"id":"p18s4","text":"client after updating."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"### 2. Configure your MCP client"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"#### Codex"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Add the configuration for your system to `~/.codex/config.toml` or your project's `.codex/config.tom"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"l`. Replace the example `command` path with the absolute path printed by the installer. In particula"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"r, a custom installation directory or `XDG_DATA_HOME` changes the path."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"If the file already has a `[features]` section, add the feature setting to that section instead of c"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"reating another one. Keep any existing MCP server settings."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"By default, `read`, `grep`, and `glob` can access any path readable by the server user. Add `\"--read"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"-scope\", \"normal\"` to `args` to restrict those tools to the repository and Codex skill/plugin paths."},{"id":"p23s3","text":" This does not restrict processes started by `run_program` or `bash`."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Windows x64"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Linux x64 / ARM64"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"macOS Apple Silicon"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"These examples set `default_tools_approval_mode` to `\"approve\"`. Review this setting against your pr"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"eferred Codex approval policy before using it."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"Cursor"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"Add the following to `~/.cursor/mcp.json`, replacing `command` with the absolute path printed by the"},{"id":"p32s2","text":" installer. On Windows, escape backslashes in JSON or use forward slashes."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"See the Cursor example."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"### 3. Check the connection"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"Restart your client and check that the AgentShim MCP server is connected. It should provide `read`, "},{"id":"p36s2","text":"`grep`, `glob`, `run_program`, `bash`, and `bash_status`. If it does not connect, check the executab"},{"id":"p36s3","text":"le path and your client's configuration, then see Diagnostics."},{"id":"p37s1","text":"## Tools and access"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"| Tool | Purpose |"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"| `read` | Read text, PDF, and Office files. |\n| `grep` | Search file contents using a Rust regex or"},{"id":"p39s2","text":" literal string. |\n| `glob` | Find files by pattern. |\n| `run_program` | Run an executable with lite"},{"id":"p39s3","text":"ral arguments, without a shell. |\n| `bash` | Run a Bash command, in the foreground or as a detached "},{"id":"p39s4","text":"job. |\n| `bash_status` | Check a detached job and read the end of its log. |"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"The MCP server uses its starting directory as the repository root. `grep` and `glob` include gitigno"},{"id":"p40s2","text":"red files by default, but exclude `.git` and common large directories."},{"id":"p41s1","text":"## Other ways to use AgentShim"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"### DSH"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"The DSH adapter loads a platform native addon in-process; it does not use the MCP server or require "},{"id":"p43s2","text":"the `agentshim` executable. Install it in the profile you use:"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"See the DSH adapter guide for requirements, configuration, and removal."},{"id":"p46s1","text":"Build from source"},{"id":"p47s1","text":"Requires Rust 1.99.1:"},{"id":"p48s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p49s1","text":"The executable is `target/release/agentshim` on Linux and macOS, or `target/release/agentshim.exe` o"},{"id":"p49s2","text":"n Windows. Use its absolute path in your MCP configuration."},{"id":"p50s1","text":"## Reference"},{"id":"p51s1","text":"Client profiles and read scope"},{"id":"p52s1","text":"`--client-profile` selects the aggregate burst policy. These layers are separate limits, not a singl"},{"id":"p52s2","text":"ent-profile` selects the aggregate burst policy. These layers are separate limits, not a single cap:"},{"id":"p53s1","text":"| Layer | Value | Meaning |\n| --- | ---: | --- |\n| Codex per-item truncation | 10,000 tokens or byte"},{"id":"p53s2","text":"s | Client history cap after `Wall time:` / `Output:` |\n| Server content ceiling | 9,872 | 10,000 mi"},{"id":"p53s3","text":"nus 128 wrapper tokens |\n| Per-call ceiling | 8,192 | Both profiles; a single page cannot exceed thi"},{"id":"p53s4","text":"s currently |\n| Burst aggregate | profile default | Remaining budget split across in-flight calls |"},{"id":"p54s1","text":"| Value | Per-call token ceiling | Default burst tokens |\n| --- | ---: | ---: |\n| `codex` (default) "},{"id":"p54s2","text":"| 8,192 | 16,384 |\n| `cursor` | 8,192 | 32,768 |"},{"id":"p55s1","text":"`AGENTSHIM_IDLE_TIMEOUT` enables idle shutdown for the `codex` profile. The `cursor` profile always "},{"id":"p55s2","text":"disables the watchdog, but setting an invalid value still fails startup."},{"id":"p56s1","text":"### `--read-scope`"},{"id":"p57s1","text":"Controls which paths `read`, `grep`, and `glob` may access outside the repository:"},{"id":"p58s1","text":"| Value | Behavior |"},{"id":"p59s1","text":"| `unrestricted` (default) | Any absolute path readable by the server user. |\n| `normal` | Repositor"},{"id":"p59s2","text":"y paths plus Codex skill/plugin directories. Credentials and history under `.codex` stay inaccessibl"},{"id":"p59s3","text":"ths plus Codex skill/plugin directories. Credentials and history under `.codex` stay inaccessible. |"},{"id":"p60s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p61s1","text":"`--read-scope` only bounds `read`, `grep`, and `glob`. MCP process tools deliberately remain unrestr"},{"id":"p61s2","text":"icted and inherit the filesystem access of the server user; agentshim does not add a process sandbox"},{"id":"p61s3","text":"cted and inherit the filesystem access of the server user; agentshim does not add a process sandbox."},{"id":"p62s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
